dns query package structure
query and reply have same structure

from top to bottom, 3 sections:

header: takes 12Bytes, first 2B is ID
question: QNAME takes 1B for length, then content, repeat, end with 0x00, QTYPE 1B, QCLASS 1B
answer: NAME same as QNAME, TYPE 1B, CLASS 1B, TTL 1B, RDLENGTH 1B length for RDATA, RDATA

